From: conda-forge maintainers <noreply@conda-forge.org>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Relax pyvis floor in metadata

conda-forge pyvis 0.3.2 ships dist-info version 0.2.0, so pip check fails.
The recipe keeps pyvis >=0.3.2 as a run dep.
---
 pyproject.toml | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/pyproject.toml b/pyproject.toml
--- a/pyproject.toml
+++ b/pyproject.toml
@@ -30,7 +30,7 @@
     "plotly>=5,<6",
     "psutil>=6,<7",
     "pytest>=8,<10",
-    "pyvis>=0.3.2",
+    "pyvis",
     "requests>=2,<3",
     "sortedcontainers<3",
     "standard-imghdr",
